WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Fleet Status Monitoring beta 2026.11.09.1. Synthetic examples; no live systems.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:11.000
The released report keeps configured systems, checked systems, health and coverage gaps distinct.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Search for build and apply the filter. Filtering changes the view without running another check.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:24.000
The build host needs attention because startup-data free space is below the configured threshold.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
No configured access means no current observation. Missing measurements remain unknown, not zero.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
A one-hour-old sample exceeds the 30-minute freshness policy. It is marked stale, not healthy.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
The checks cover startup-data capacity and freshness. This offline example has no backend and live refresh is disabled.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Download the interactive example or share this walkthrough. Install the beta channel explicitly.
